{
    // the same without gyrofile: every bath species is taken from the built-in isotope table (src/input/isotope_table.cpp,
    // EasySpin isotopes): 13C, spin 1/2, 6.72828544 rad/ms/G against 6.728284 in the gyro file. Species that are not
    // isotopes (P1, Vp, ...) still need a gyrofile.
